# ---- Unity demo project: LOCAL ONLY, never published ----
# 1.6 GB, and Assets/Art + Terrain + Audio are third-party Asset Store
# content we have no right to redistribute. Assets/Art/Sand_A_Normal.tif
# alone is 132 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit. The publishable Unity
# surface is the UPM package under unity/.
UnityIntegration/

# ---- local-only working material ----
# Pre-cleanup artifacts kept for reference. Contains unverified benchmark
# output and must never be published.
_archive/
# Planning and competition-submission notes: about the process, not the
# software. Deliberately not part of the public repository.
IMPROVEMENT.md
SUBMISSION.md
DEVPOST.md
# Source drop used to hand the tree to a machine that could not clone it.
# Build products belong in a release, not in the history.
vane.tar.gz

